&= \lbrack x^k \rbrack ( (1+3x)+x^2)^{2N} \\
&=\lbrack x^k \rbrack \sum_{0 \leq j \leq 2N} \binom{2N}{j}x^{2j} (1+3x)^{2N-j} \\
